# Frontend environment configuration (Phase 5 foundation).
#
# Base URL used by the frontend API boundary (established in Phase 5.3).
# During development this points at the Vite dev-server proxy path so that
# requests are forwarded to the FastAPI backend (http://localhost:8000)
# without requiring any CORS changes on the locked backend.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and adjust only if needed. Never commit `.env`.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
